            {
              "text": "Section A. Force, Decks, Piles, & The Table",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "The Force is an energy field generated by all living things and represented as the basic unit of measurement in the game (1 unit of Life Force = 1 card). Since the game revolves around players offensively and defensively manipulating their Life Force, understanding how the Force is represented and used is extremely important. During play, your Force cards will circulate through your piles as shown in the diagram.",
