              "text": "Also, when an action places multiple cards in to a player's hand, deck, or pile, and the card's game text does not state which player may decide the order of those cards, placing each card is considered a competing automatic action, and the order is decided by the player whose turn it is. When a card is placed into (or on, on top of, on bottom of, exchanged with a card within, etc.) a hand, deck, pile, or stack, do not reveal the card(s) unless instructed to do so, or in the following situations:",
