          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Deploying/Playing From A Deck Or Pile",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "When permitted to deploy or play a card from a place other than your hand, you must still obey normal timing rules of the card being played or deployed (unless specifically told otherwise, such as Nal Hutta Operative). Thus you cannot deploy a site using Tatooine: Jabba's Palace except during your deploy phase, nor could you deploy a starfighter ' stacked ' on Rebel Fleet outside of your deploy phase.",
