        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 13,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Actions occur quite naturally during the game; in fact, most of the time you don't even need to think about actions (just as you rarely need to think about the individual steps of how you get dressed in the morning).",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 13,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Occasionally, however, situations will arise where it is desirable to understand the intricate details of actions-particularly in tournaments, where players want strict and definitive rules governing the specifi ctiming of game play. Almost everything you do in the game is an action. Examples of commonly occurring actions include:",
              "bold": false,
