              "text": "Action Within An Action",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Many times, an action causes other actions to occur within itself. For example, a Force drain is an action which typically causes the opponent to lose Force-another action. For a more complex example, consider playing Nabrun Leids; this action includes several other actions:",
