              "text": "Top",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "-",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "level actions",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "are the most common action you'll perform; they're the actions that kick things off, such as deploying a character or activating a Force.",
