        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 14,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Some actions you can choose to have happen, and some actions have to happen. For example, you don't have to Force drain, you can choose to do it or not do it (sometimes it's in your best interest not to), but you do have to have your creatures attack if they can (even when it would be bad, like attacking your own characters!).",
