        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 14,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "So there are top level actions and reare things that you can choose to happen or that must happen. Thus, there are four types of actions that take place: Optional Actions, Automatic Actions, Mandatory Actions, and Just Actions.",
