              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Force draining Drawing asteroid destiny Initiating a battle Creatures attacking prey A group of characters Losing Force to Visage of level action attacking a creature -Firing a weapon in a battle Paying maintenance costs Top",
              "bold": false,
