            {
              "text": "Result -The first part of Set For Stun's result is its destiny draw. This destiny draw becomes the current own initiation, optional responses and result. Light does not respond to the destiny draw, so it has its result (which is actually drawing the destiny card). Dark draws a destiny of 2 and Light has Tauntaun Bones on table.",
