              "text": "When a card in a hand, deck, or pile has game text that allows itself to be targeted by anothe rcard, that game text is considered active and will function normally if the targeting card is searching through that hand, deck, or pile (see Actions -Immune for a similar ruling about cards that are immune to other cards).",
