          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Dark is given the choice to have his location conve rted but declines. Light is now given the choice; unfortunately for him, he needs that as his starting location, so he deploys Coruscant and Dark converts it with his own. Starting Interrupts are now revealed; Dark uses Twi'lek Advisor to deploy Bad Feeling Have I.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 38,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Light uses Careful Planning (V) (the same as Combat Readiness (V)); even though his location was converted, it was a system so he may still play it; he deploys a related site and three Effects. He need not deploy a battleground site because even though his system was converted, it was a battleground. After that is done, starting hands are drawn.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 38,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Starting The Game",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "-",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Example 5",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Both players simultaneously reveal their Starting Effects, then deploy them and place cards underneath.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 38,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Objectives/starting locations are now revealed: both players reveal Tatooine: Cantina. Dark is given the choice to have his location converted, but declines.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 38,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Light also declines. The two Cantinas are set aside and they both select a second location; Dark chooses Kessel and light chooses Tatooine: Cantina (he had two in his deck). Since the locations are both different, they are both deployed and the two Cantinas are returned to their owners' decks. Starting interrupts are then revealed and resolve, then starting hands are drawn.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 38,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Turn",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Six consecutive phases of play (activate, control, deploy, battle, move and draw) executed by one player.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 38,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Information on what those phases are and common events that occur during them are listed in Chapters 3 -8.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 38,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Anything that states that it happens during a turn never happens before the first turn begins or after the last turn ends. In addition, top-level actions such as playing a Used Interrupt cannot be initiated before the first turn begins, or after the last turn ends.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 38,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Start Of Turn/Beginning Of Your Turn",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "See Start of Turn, Ch. 3.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 38,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "End Of Turn",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "See End Of Turn, Ch. 8.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
