        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 54,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Power Segment",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "During the power segment, players will calculate their total power to determine who wins the battle, and by how much. But first, players may have the opportunity to draw power destinies, battle destinies, and a ttrition destinies to improve their outcome. A few other types of actions can also be played during this segment, as detailed below.",
