            {
              "text": "is no option to decl ine). Each power destiny increases the player ' stotal power in the battle.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 54,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Next, the other player repeats this process, calculating",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 54,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Power Segment",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "-",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Draw Battle Destinies",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "The player who initiated the battle is first to calculate how many battle destinies they are entitled to.",
