        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 54,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "As a general rule, a player who has a combined ability of 4 or more participating in the battle may make one battle destiny draw. (Having 8 ability present does not entitle you to draw two battle destiny.) To meet the 4 ability requirement, you count the a bility of:",
