        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 55,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "• Any automatic modifiers (e.g. Jeroen Webb) or resets (e.g. Zuckuss In Mist Hunter) are applied at • Top-level actions which modify or reset both this time if their conditions are currently met.",
