              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Death Stars (Death Star and Death Star II) are permitted only one form of movement: using hyperspeed. The hyperspeed of the original Death Star is defined in its game text (or by other cards), while that of Death Star II is defined by That Thing's Operational.",
