            },
            {
              "text": "Some cards initiate actions that will allow (or force) a character to relocate from one location to another Star (it has a nav computer and sufficient hyperspeed) location. For example, Nabrun Leids moves a group of characters from one location to another, Trap Door will relocate a character from the Audience Chamber to the the cargo hold (this is free).",
