              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "The phrase \"cannot move\" means that a card cannot make any regular move, unlimited move, or 'react'. See Movement. This does not stop a card from being \"carried.\" See Movement-car rying cards. When an action attempts to move a group of cards, and one or some of those cards cannot move, the action is not canceled; simply move all cards in the group that are able to move.",
