            {
              "text": "For a character to \"move away\" (by cards such as Obi -Wan Kenobi, Move Along..., Neb Dulo, Dodge), the character must use its landspeed to move from one site to a related site. Thus a \" move away \" action for a character can only be initiated if at a site (and a related site is on table). If on a vehicle or landed starship, the character automatically disembarks, but only if successfully moving away. If a character is on a vehicle and both are to move away, moving the vehicle first will naturally carry the character away as well, at which Luke Skywalker and a landed Xpoint the character may no longer make a \" move away \" permanent pilot) are at Tatooin move.",
