        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 71,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Dark initiates battle there and Light wishes to play Hyper Escape. To initiate Hyper Escape, there must be at least one valid destination location on table, and there is one, Coruscant (par sec 0). Light is permitted to initiate Hyper Escape.",
