        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 71,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Light chooses the order to move their starships. First, they attempt to move the X-wing. The only system the X-wing can reach from Kessel is Raithal, so Light uses 1 Force to move it there. Dark responds with Gravity Shad owwhich stops the X-wing from moving. Next, Light uses 1 Force to move the Falcon to Kiffex successfully. Lastly, Light wants to move the Y-wing, but there is no system in range, so it fails to move and the Hyper Escape action is now completed.",
