            },
            {
              "text": "-wing (which has a e: Docking Bay 94. Dark initiates battle there and Light wishes to play Narrow Escape which says \" move all of your cards with ability there away (using their landspeed). \" There are two problems for Light. First, Narrow Escape specifically targets Lights cards with ability to ensure that they have landspeed when initiating this Interrupt.",
