          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Second, it ' snoteworthy that even if Light had been able to initiate the Int errupt, it is not possible for a landed starship to \" move away \", since taking off / landing is not a valid option for a starship making a \" move away \" move. So even if Light had been able to play Narrow Escape, the landed X-wing would have failed to move.",
