            },
            {
              "text": "-",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "moves like a character",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Cards which move like a character are not characters, but may move like characters utilizing a landspeed of 1, docking bay transit, embarking, disembarking, moving between docked starships and shuttling where appropriate. These cards do not take up passenger capacity. These cards may not be moved or affected by other cards which work on characters (e.g., they cannot be transported with Nabrun Leids).",
