        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 75,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Therefore, both players together are limited to a total of three such Asteroid Field locations at each planet system. Likewise, a starship with  uniqueness may not be deployed to a location where another copy of that  starship already exists, either at the same location or a location related to the same system, and may not move to the same or related location as another copy of that  starship.",
