              "text": "Characters",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "A type of card that represen tsthe individuals who participated in the events of Star Wars (Rebel, Imperial, alien, droid, etc.). A few characters represent more than one of these things; for example, Chewbacca (in the A New Hope expansion set) is both a Rebel and an alien.",
