            },
            {
              "text": "Effects",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Effects (sometimes called \"normal Effects\" for clarification) are identified by their Effect icon in the upper-left corner of their card, and the single keyword \"Effect\" in their subtype box (just below the picture). your deploy phase like normal Effect cards, but have a These Effects are deployed during your deploy phase.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
