              "text": "-",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Immediate Effects",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Immediate Effects are identified by their Effect icon in the upper-left corner of their card, and \"Immediate Effect\" in their subtype box. Unlike other types of Effects, Immediate Effects are not limited to the deploy phase. They will deploy as a response, or during a specific time (or any time, if no time is stated) as indicated by their game text.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
