              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Utinni Effects",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Utinn i Effects are identified by their Effect icon in the subtype box. Utinni Effects are deployed during your deploy phase (unless indicated otherwise) like normal Effect cards, and usually require you to choose a specific card on table that the Utinni Effect is targeting.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 82,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "character, vehicle, or starship to move to a specific location (usually the one where the Utinni Effect is deployed) in order to cancel a negative condition or initiate a positive one. Where they deploy and how they act is specified within their game text. If the target of an Utinni Effect leaves the table (or becomes inactive), the Utinni Effect is lost (or inactive). See inactive, Ch. 1",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "'reaching' an Utinni Effect",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "A target \"reaches\" an Utinni Effect that is deployed on a location when:",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 82,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "• the target is present at the location; or",
