              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 82,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "• the target is in a pilot, passenger or astromech slot of a starship that is present at that location or",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 82,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "• the target is in a pilot, driver or passenger slot of a vehicle that is present at that location.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 82,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "For example: Our Most Desperate Hour is deployed on the Alderaan system targeting Leia on Tatooine. Leia moves from Docking Bay 94 to the",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Home One",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": ": Docking Bay (the starship",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Home One",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "is present at the Alderaan system). Leia has not yet \"reached\" the Utinni Effect, as she is not in a pilot or passenger slot. To trigger the Utinni Effect, she would need to use her regular move next turn to move from the Docking Bay to the \"bridge\" of",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
