              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 86,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Asteroid Sector",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "-All starships can deploy, move, and battle there as if it was a system.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 86,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Cloud Sector",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "-Only shuttle vehicles, cloud cars, patrol craft, squadrons, and starfighters may deploy there. Of course starships that may 'deploy like a starfighter' or 'move like a starfighter' are also eligible.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 86,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Death Star II Sector",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "-No cards may deploy here! They must move in from the Death Star IIsystem itself.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Locations",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "-",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "General",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Adjacent",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Some cards refer to adjacent sites or sectors (systems cannot be adjacent). These are related sites or sectors that have been played next to each other. Cards may move from location to adjacent loca tion like a sequence of connected spaces on a game board. Two location cards are adjacent only if they are (1) the same kind of location (site or sector), (2) physically next to each other and (3) part of the same system, starship etc. (Vehicle sites a realso adjacent to the planet site where the vehicle is located.) Locations can be physically next to each other on table without being adjacent (e.g., a system next to a sector).",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Characteristics",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Locations do not have characteristics; instead they will bereferred to by an element of their title or a defined attribute about them (e.g., prison, subjugated planet, etc.). Thus, for example, any card with \"desert\" in title or is provided that attribute somehow is considered a desert. However, see Throne Room.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Cloud City Locations",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "All Cloud City locations (including Bespin: Cloud City) are Bespin locations as well as Cloud City locations.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Thus they are related to any Bespin site, sector, or system location. A card is \"on Cloud City\" if it is at a Cloud City site (not at a sector).",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Jabba's PalaceS ites",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "All Jabba's Palace (including Tatooine: Jabba's Palace) locations are considered to be Tatooine locations as well as Jabba's Palace locations. Thus they are related to any Tatooine site, sector, or system location.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Maz",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "'",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "s CastleS ites",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "All Maz's Castle locations (including Takodana: Maz's Castle) are considered to be Takodana locations as well as Maz's Castle locations. Thus they are related to any Takodana site, sector, or system location.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Prisons",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Prisons will state \"Prison\" in their title. Also, three sites are defined as prisons:",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "•Death Star: Detention Block Corridor •Cloud City: Security Tower •Jabba's Palace: Dungeon",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Rebel Base",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Any Yavin 4 or Hoth location is a Rebel Base loc ation.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Xizor",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "'",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "s PalaceS ites",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "This includes related cloud sectors but not asteroid sectors in the same system. For the purpose of Commence Primary Ignition, cloud sectors increase the potential damage but do not decrease the chance for success. The planet indicated by the Hidden Base card is conceptually unknown to the Empire and thus is not considered a Rebel Base for game play purposes (unless the Light player were to choose Yavin 4 or Hoth to be his 'hidden base').",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Related Locations",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Sites, cloud sectors, and Death Star IIsec tors that are deployed to the same system are",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "• related to that system;",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "• related to other sites and cloud sectors deployed to that system; and",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "• part of that system.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Asteroid sectors that are deployed to the same system are",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "• related to that system;",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "• related to each other; but",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "• not part of that system (e.g., an asteroid sector at the Dagobah system is not a Dagobah location) and not related to normal sites or cloud sectors in that system.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "The Big One Cave is related only to the Big One. A location is not rel ated to itself.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "The exception to these rules is that a starship site or a Death Star or Death Star IIsite is not a related site to the system that the starship (or Death Star) is orbiting, and similarly the system is not a related system to that starship (or Death Star) site.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "When a starship or vehicle has its own sites, and that starship or vehicle card is at a site (not at a system or sector), the starship or vehicle sites are related to that site and its related locations.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "A starship, Death Star, Death Star II or vehicle site is related to its other starship, Death Star, Death Star II or vehicle sites.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Same A nd RelatedS ites",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Cards using this phrase must be at a site to utilize the associated game text. See Related locations.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "SameS ystem",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Unless specifically noted otherwise, \"same system\" refers directly to the system location and does not extend to the related sites or sectors of that system.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "System Location",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "See Ch. 4, System location.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Throne Room",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Death Star II: Throne Room, Naboo: Theed Palace Throne Room, and Yavin 4: Massassi Throne Room are all throne rooms. However, to avoid confusion, a reference to \"Throne Room\" is to Death Star II: Throne Room, and the other two sites will be referred to by their title. For a card targeting all three, it will state \"any throne room.\"",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 87,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "All Xizor's Palace (including Coruscant: Xizor's Palace) locations are considered to be Coruscant locations as well as Xizor's Palace locations. Thus they are related to any Coruscant site, sector, or system location.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 88,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Locations",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "-",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Icons",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 88,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Mobile Starship site",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 88,
          "textRuns": [
