            {
              "text": "sdefined on the vehicle or starship card.",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "When a vehicle or starfighter's capacity includes pilots, drivers and/or passengers, this capacity conceptually represents the bridge or cockpit. When its capacity includes vehicles and starfighters, this capacity conceptually represents the cargo hold. Only characters which are conceptually \"on the bridge\" (or cockpit) take up capacity; those at a related starship or vehicle site do not occupy capacity on the \"outer\" starship or vehicle, and may not pilot, drive orotherwise enhance that vehicle or starship.",
