        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 92,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Creature vehicles are identified by their vehicle icon in the upper-left corner of their card, and the keyword \"Creature\" in their description box (just below the pic ture). Creature vehicles have ability, and thus do not require drivers or pilots. For this reason, a creature vehicle is never considered \"unpiloted\". If a creature vehicle is about to be lost, any characters aboard it may \"jump off\" (disembark) at the sam esite and survive.",
