              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Transport vehicles are identified by their vehicle icon in the upper-left corner of their card, and the keyword \"Transport\" in their description box (just below the picture). Transport vehicles have drivers rather than pilots (see Drivers).",
