            {
              "text": "Some cards can cause a vehicle to crash. A crashed vehicle is considered unpiloted (see Starships -Unpiloted); thus any permanent pilots (or drivers) aboard function as passengers that provide presence but may not use their ability towards drawing battle destiny. Note that they still occupy pilot/driver capacity on the vehicle however. Pilot characters are treated as passengers (though they still occupy the pilot capacity), thus any text that only works while piloting would be useless. If the 'crashed' vehicle is enclosed:",
