            {
              "text": "deployment",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Vehicles deploy only to locations where you have presence or at least one Force icon on your side of that location. Vehicles may deploy to exterior sites, or to the \"cargo hold\" of a starship if sufficient capacity exists.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
