              "text": "deployingonor a board",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "You may deploy characters directly aboard vehicles with sufficient character capacity at any location where you have presence or Force icons. Weapons, devices, Effects and similar cards may be deployed wherever appropriate, with or without presence or Forc eicons.",
