        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 96,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Permanent weapons may not be separated from a vehicle or starship, and may not be separated from a chara cter (lost, stolen, transferred, retrieved etc.) except by cards that disarm. If a character is no longer disarmed, the weapon is restored. Game text that relocates weapons (e.g., to or from a pile) may not be",
