              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "A weapon that states it may \"fire repeatedly\" (e.g., and second is 3 and 6 for a total of 7. Together they Antipersonnel Laser Cannon, Boba Fett's Blaster Rifle, etc.). A weapon that does not state this is not a repeating weapon (e.g., Maul's Double -Bladed",
