              "text": "Attack Run describes how to blow away the Death Star (this is an Epic Event destiny draw). Note that this Epic Event has been errat a'ed so that proton torpedoes are immune to Overload while Attack Run is on table. Also note that proton torpedoes is an attribute, so you may use any starship weapon with that attribute.",
