          "pageRef": 157,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "Your lead starfighter must have proton torpedoes to perform an Attack Run. If your lead starfighter is somehow lost while you still have wingmates, you may select one of the wingmates to become the lead starfighter if that starfighter has Proton Torpedoes. The Attack Run will immediately end if at any time there are no light side starfighters with proton torpedoes.",
