            {
              "text": "Examples",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Undercover is deployed on Leia Organa at the Death Star: Conference Room where The Emperor and Lord Vader (armed with a lightsaber) are present. Leia is inactive and thus not on table for most purposes.",
