              "text": "Guards",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Anyone with a characteristic including the word \"guard\" (or \"bodyguard\" or \"MagnaGuard\") has that characteristic and the guard characteristic. Thus bodyguards, Coruscant guards, etc all are considered",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
