              "text": "Species",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Examples of species are Wookiees, Jawas, Hutts, Tusken Raiders, Ewoks, and Corellians (yes, Corellians are actually a race of humans; for simplicity we refer to all such identifications as species). Mandalorians are a speci esfor gameplay purposes. Human is not considered a species (since it is subdivided into different races), nor is humanoid.",
