              "bold": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Anyone with a characteristic containing the word \"trooper\" (even within another word) has that characteristic and the trooper characteristic. Thus Rebel troopers, stormtroopers, Cloud City troopers, etc. all are considered troopers in addition to those characteristics.",
