            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 179,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "In the event that a card title matches the persona name (e.g. Boba Fett, Emperor or Vader), references to that name are conside red to refer to the persona, not the individual card. If the specific card is the intended target, a set reference will be included (typically using Leader of the First Order) set icons, e.g. Boba Fett, Emperor).",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "pageRef": 179,
          "textRuns": [
            {
              "text": "When a character crosses over, their persona name changes (see Crossing Over, Ch. 5).",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false
